# The pinned upstream reference trees, fetched by scripts/fetch-upstream.sh.
#
# ~753 MB of Krita and GIMP source. Before this rule they were untracked but NOT ignored, so a
# `git add -A` would have committed three quarters of a gigabyte of another project's source.
# redrob-graphics ports behaviour from these; it does not vendor them.
/upstream/
